g forward with the desire to do good, and love those around me, I know I wi=
ll make it through whatever comes my way. I am grateful for your prayers, a=
nd I am grateful for you.</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto=
">Yes, you! I love you so so so much! Each and every one of you are so prec=
ious to me. Please keep your head up, and know that there are others going =
through trials too! Also know that God understands your trials better than =
you do! Be humble. And choose the hard right over the easy wrong.</div><div=
 dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Guess what, it&#39;s gonna be har=
d! but it&#39;s 1000000% worth it, thanks to the Savior, Jesus Christ.</div=
><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Love you guys!</div></div>

